  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Supplementary Feeding Project.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a supplementary feeding project aimed at at children under five, pregnant and lactating women. In the project site areas, the have been a long spell of drought and famine which is expected to end by the end of March / April 2010. Until then there remains a need for emergency food support in the three months period which would be classified as the hunger gap period.</narrative>
  </description>
